# DeliRAG 环境配置模板（第二版 pgvector 轻量化）
# 用法：复制为 .env.local 并填入真实值（.env.local 不会提交到仓库）

# ── PostgreSQL / ParadeDB 知识库（docker compose 起 paradedb 容器）──
PG_HOST=127.0.0.1
PG_PORT=5434
PG_USER=deli
PG_PASSWORD=delipg123
PG_DATABASE=deli_qa
PG_TABLE=kb_chunks
DEFAULT_TENANT_ID=tenant_deli

# ── 大模型（任意 OpenAI 兼容端点，如 DeepSeek / 硅基流动）──
LLM_API_KEY=sk-在此填入你的key
LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
LLM_MODEL=deepseek-chat
LLM_TEMPERATURE=0
LLM_MAX_TOKENS=2048

# ── MySQL ──
MYSQL_HOST=127.0.0.1
MYSQL_PORT=3307
MYSQL_USER=root
MYSQL_PASSWORD=你的MySQL密码
MYSQL_DATABASE=deli_qa

# ── Redis ──
REDIS_HOST=127.0.0.1
REDIS_PORT=6380
REDIS_PASSWORD=你的Redis密码
REDIS_DB=0

# ── 本地模型权重（BGE 系路径必须纯 ASCII）──
# bge-small-zh-v1.5 权重可从 ModelScope 下载：
#   modelscope download --model BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5 --local_dir /path/to/bge-small-zh-v1.5
EMBEDDING_LOCAL_MODEL_PATH=E:/edurag_models/bge-small-zh-v1.5
RERANKER_MODEL_PATH=E:/edurag_models/bge-reranker-large
BERT_BASE_MODEL_PATH=E:/edurag_models/bert-base-chinese
FINETUNED_CLASSIFIER_PATH=models/classifier/bert_query_classifier

# ── Embedding 后端：local（bge-small-zh 512维，服务器默认）| siliconflow（bge-m3 1024维）──
# 切换后端必须：改 EMBEDDING_DIM -> python scripts/init_pg.py --force -> 重新全量入库
EMBEDDING_BACKEND=local
EMBEDDING_SF_MODEL=BAAI/bge-m3
EMBEDDING_DIM=512
EMBEDDING_BATCH_SIZE=32

# ── Reranker 后端：local | siliconflow（4GB 服务器建议，零内存；故障自动降级 RRF 序）──
# 换后端后必须用标准题重新标定 MIN_RELEVANT_SCORE / HIGH_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD
RERANK_BACKEND=local
RERANK_SF_MODEL=BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3
RERANK_BATCH_SIZE=32

# ── SiliconFlow 在线接口（注册 https://siliconflow.cn 免费取 key，embedding/rerank 免费额度）──
SF_API_KEY=
SF_BASE_URL=https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1
SF_TIMEOUT=15

# ── 检索参数 ──
FAQ_BM25_THRESHOLD=0.85
RECALL_TOP_K=10
RERANK_TOP_K=3
RECALL_CANDIDATE_LIMIT=50
MIN_RELEVANT_SCORE=0.05
HIGH_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.45
FUSION_STRATEGY=rrf
RRF_K=60
FUSION_DENSE_WEIGHT=0.6
FUSION_SPARSE_WEIGHT=0.4
CHUNK_SIZE=512
CHUNK_OVERLAP=64
CONTEXTUAL_RAG=true

# ── 业务常量 ──
VALID_SOURCES=["product", "safety", "ops", "franchise", "supply"]
CUSTOMER_SERVICE_PHONE=13112345678

# ── 服务 ──
APP_HOST=0.0.0.0
APP_PORT=8082
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
KB_MCP_SERVER_PORT=8001
